cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FIREFLY in published work, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "FIREFLY: Fluorescence Inference & Reconstruction Engine — Framework for Localization Yields"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for single-particle tracking PALM (sptPALM) analysis of
  Zeiss .czi and TIFF image stacks: localisation, linking, MSD, diffusion and
  motion-class analysis, a three-state hidden Markov model of diffusive states,
  drift correction, clustering, and multi-group comparison with corrected
  statistics.
authors:
  - family-names: Levers
    given-names: Jacob
version: 2.76.56-rc.1
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jacob-levers/FIREFLY"
url: "https://github.com/jacob-levers/FIREFLY"
keywords:
  - single-particle tracking
  - sptPALM
  - super-resolution microscopy
  - diffusion
  - hidden Markov model
